<title>UK: Canada's CMHC prices $500 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Canada's CMHC prices $500 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers DKB International and Merrill Lynch International, has now been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CANADA MORTGAGE AND HOUSING CORP (CMHC)</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    02.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.606   PAY DATE  S-09.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.981    SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ONTARIO   HOME CTRY  CANADA    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p> NOTES    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		CMHC IS AN AGENT OF HER MAJESTY IN RIGHT OF CANADA,</p>
<p>		AND THE BONDS CARRY FULL FAITH AND CREDIT OF CANADA</p>
<p>		AND CONSTITUTE DIRECT UNCONDITIONAL OBLIGATIONS OF</p>
<p>		AND BY CANADA.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
